SUMMARY:Teen Open Mic
DESCRIPTION:Perform at Youth Music Project’s Teen Open Mic Nights!\nAre you a musician aged 13-18? Come on down and share your songs with a live\, supportive audience. This is an incredible opportunity to hone your skills while performing with state-of-the-art gear and sound engineers on our Meteor Lounge stage. \nOpen Mic Nights are held on the first Friday of each month and hosted by our amazing Teen Interns.  \nSign-up at the doors at 6:15 p.m | Performances begin 6:30 p.m.\n\nDon’t have a song to share? No worries! Gather some friends and come be a part of our supportive audience! All ages welcome to attend.\n\nNote: Parent/guardian permission and a signed media waiver are required for performers under the age of 18.\n\nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/teen-open-mic/2026-05-01/
LOCATION:Youth Music Project\, 2015 8th Ave\, West Linn\, 97068\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Kids Calendar,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Open-House-Thumb-1-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Youth Music Project":MAILTO:info@youthmusicproject.org
END:VEVENT
