SUMMARY:2026 Spring Garden Fair
DESCRIPTION:Green thumbs\, rejoice: this Canby favorite returns May 2–3\, 2026\, with plant shopping\, gardening help and educational demos. Children under 16 are free. Free parking. \nBring your junior gardener in for some kid sized fun ~ the theme this year is Cycles in the Garden – from Seed to Plant. \nKids can plant lettuce\, dissect a seed to observe the tiny plant inside\, create a seed to plant flip book\, build a little sprout house and plant something for the pollinators.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/2026-spring-garden-fair/2026-05-02/
