SUMMARY:13th Annual Oregon Steps Against Melanoma
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring morning at the 13th Annual Steps Against Melanoma walk in Oregon. Take part in a walk/run\, grab giveaways\, enjoy music from a DJ\, and connect with others for some family-friendly fun (dogs welcome too!). This powerful community event brings together survivors\, caregivers\, families\, and friends who have been touched by melanoma\, all united by one goal: ending melanoma. Every step you take supports AIM at Melanoma’s mission and fuels critical research. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
