SUMMARY:Opening Weekend Celebration + Baby Animals at Frog Pond Farm
DESCRIPTION:The spring season has finally arrived!  Celebrate with us! \nOn May 1st\, the gates open at Frog Pond Farm in Wilsonville where baby animal season is officially underway. Have you ever met a baby llama? Now is your chance! \nCome meet camels\, llamas\, mini donkeys\, goats\, pigs\, cows\, and more\, plus all the spring babies everyone has been waiting for. With 10+ acres to explore\, Frog Pond Farm offers a full day of outdoor fun designed for all ages. \n✔️ Meet & feed 80+ animals\, including spring babies\n✔️ Bounce\, climb\, and play in the covered Bounce Park (rain or shine)\n✔️ Live shows and hands-on farm experiences\n✔️ Coffee and fresh apple cider donuts made fresh daily  \n✔️ Plenty of space to wander\, play\, and connect \nPerfect for families\, playdates\, and anyone looking for an easy\, joy-filled day outdoors. \n🎟️General Admission: $13 (ages 2+)\nIncludes all-day access to animals\, Bounce Park\, and play areas.\nAnimal feed cups available for purchase. \nMake opening weekend the start of your season\, and come back again with a Season Pass to watch the babies grow all spring and summer. \nWant to make your visit extra memorable? Llama Walks are available by advance booking later in May. \nLooking for things to do with kids near Portland or Salem this weekend? Visit Frog Pond Farm. It’s all here. \n📍 Frog Pond Farm | Wilsonville\, Oregon \n📅 Open May 1 – September 7 \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/opening-weekend-celebration-baby-animals-at-frog-pond-farm/2026-05-02/
LOCATION:Frog Pond Farm\, 2995 SW Advance Rd\, Wilsonville\, OR\, 97070\, United States
CATEGORIES:Animals,Educational,Family Fun,Farm,Kids Calendar,Outdoor
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/2026-Opening-Weekend-Event-Cover.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Frog Pond Farm":MAILTO:abbie.frogpondfarm@gmail.com
