SUMMARY:Visit Adelman Peony Gardens
DESCRIPTION:Delight in beautiful peony blooms at Adelman Peony Gardens this spring! Free admission and free parking\, this is a gorgeous way to spend a few hours\, plus tons of perfect photo ops! Bring a picnic\, walk their 30 acres of production fields\, stroll through 2 acres of display garden\, viewing indoor peony bloom displays\, and purchase cut flowers or peonies in containers to take home. Pet-friendly\, walker and wheelchair accessible. Check their current bloom status here!  \nPeak bloom time is usually around Memorial Day weekend\, but can vary depending on the spring weather. \nApril 25 – June 15\, 9 am to 6 pm Daily.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/visit-adelman-peony-gardens/2026-05-02/
LOCATION:Adelman Peony Gardens\, 5690 Brooklake Rd. NE\, Salem\, Oregon\, 97305
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Kids Calendar,Mother's Day,Outdoor,Plants & Nature
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Adelman-Peony-Gardens-1.png
END:VEVENT
