SUMMARY:Toddler & Me Drop-In Ballet Playtime
DESCRIPTION:IMA Academy invites families to drop-in for this fun ballet class where we discover ballet moves while jumping and crawling through an obstacle course\, pretending to be animals\, and playing musical pizza. \nThis parents/guardian drop-in ballet class is for young dancers ages 2-3.5\, to learn ballet all while being silly\, using imagination\, and moving together. \nNo previous dance is necessary. Families of all backgrounds and abilities are welcome. \nWear whatever fun and safe dance outfit inspires you\, or borrow some. The floors are marley (vinyl)\, so ballet slippers or socks work great. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/toddler-me-drop-in-ballet-playtime/
